<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Regulatory Accounting function for Affiliate billing to comply with federal regulations. In the US specifically, it is Title 47, Part 64 (Telecommunication - Miscellaneous Rules Relating to Common Carriers).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

