<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Building Portfolios Management manages different types of property and in different real estate markets. Building portfolio functions supports the management of the property portfolio.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/FunctionModel_v1#F.Property Lease Management -->

<owl:Class rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/FunctionModel_v1#F.Property Lease Management">
