<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Real Estate Facility Management prioritizes the day-to-day operations to increase the user/occupier's workplace needs and demands. Real Estate Facility Management function supports the Facility Managers control of the expenses and operational planning.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/FunctionModel_v1#F.Property Floor Plan Management -->

<owl:Class rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/FunctionModel_v1#F.Property Floor Plan Management">
