<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Space Planning Utilization Management is used for benchmarking, space efficiency and quickly identifying vacant and underutilized space, used for planning and space optimization.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/FunctionModel_v1#F.Space/Cost of Fixed Assets Planning -->

